===Etymology===
{{transliteration|en|hi|श्रीनगर|tr=śrīnagar}}, from  {{der|en|sa|श्री}} + {{m|sa|नगर||town, city}}. Compare {{noncog|ur|سِرِی نَگَر|tr=sirī nagar}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/sɹiˈnɑːɡəɹ/|/ʃɹiˈnɑːɡɚ/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q170115}}{{place|en|city/summer capital|uterr/Jammu and Kashmir|c/India}}. It is situated in the [[Kashmir]] valley on the banks of the river [[Jhelum]] and famous for its gardens.

